          "fix_text": "Configure Rapid STP or MSTP to be implemented at the access and distribution layers where VLANs span multiple switches as shown in the examples below:\n\nSW2(config)#spanning-tree mode rapid-pvst\n\nor \n\nSW1(config)#spanning-tree mode mst",
