          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: be6b611a6ce3af30cfad1166d418ae98034301b63423515ba5bf0b069a79f313\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: 6ea04e54af46122495d50fe5810cf2021e5eec12b22c3b4bcad667d91dfc54c9\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
          "fix_text": "Assign all switch ports not in use to an inactive VLAN.\n\nStep 1: Assign the disabled interfaces to an inactive VLAN:\n\nSW3(config)#int range g0/0 – 9\nSW3(config-if-range)# switchport access vlan 999\n\nStep 2: Configure trunk links to not allow traffic from the inactive VLAN:\n\nSW3(config)#int g1/1\nSW3(config-if)#switchport trunk allowed vlan except 999",
